# IEEE RAS NIT Silchar Website

The official website project for the **IEEE Robotics and Automation Society (RAS), NIT Silchar Student Branch**. The application provides the website's public pages and a basic account registration and login flow.

Repository: [UdC-005/NitS-ieee-ras-website](https://github.com/UdC-005/NitS-ieee-ras-website)

## Tech Stack

- **Backend:** Python, FastAPI, Uvicorn
- **Templating:** Jinja2
- **Frontend:** HTML, CSS, JavaScript, with the site's compiled Tailwind CSS styles
- **Database access:** SQLAlchemy
- **Database:** Any SQLAlchemy-supported database configured through `DATABASE_URL` (PostgreSQL is suitable for deployment; SQLite can be used for local development)
- **Authentication:** bcrypt password hashing and JWT access tokens

## Features

- Public website pages such as Home, About, and Projects
- Members and Learning pages when those page modules are included in the current working branch
- Blog/news page with an HTML-scraping integration for IEEE RAS news, when the scraper module is configured
- User registration using full name, Scholar ID, email, and password
- Login and logout routes
- Password hashing and JWT-based access-token cookie
- Static asset serving for stylesheets, JavaScript, and images
- Health-check endpoint at `/health`

> **Note:** The members, learning, blog/news, and page-loader additions may exist only in a newer local branch or working copy. If one of these pages is absent after cloning the default branch, check that the corresponding feature files and route registrations have been committed to your branch.

